# Mintlify automatically ignores these files and directories:
# .git, .github, .claude, .agents, .idea, node_modules,
# README.md, LICENSE.md, CHANGELOG.md, CONTRIBUTING.md
#
# `npx skills add` still writes `.agents/` and `.claude/` locally. Name them here so
# `mintlify validate` does not try to symlink a second `ecp` skill (EPERM on Windows).
.agents/
.claude/

# Draft content
drafts/
*.draft.mdx

node_modules
dist
*.log
typedoc.json